# OS clutter
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Obsidian: per-machine state. The **/ prefix matches at any depth, so a
# vault opened on a wiki's own folder is covered too. The rest of .obsidian/
# may be committed, to share settings across machines.
**/.obsidian/workspace*
**/.obsidian/cache
**/.obsidian/*.bak

# Agent and editor files that belong to one machine or one person
**/.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# A staging folder for the kit's own maintenance
_incoming/

# Sources in raw/ ARE committed: git is the backup, and the source ledger
# assumes every source is under version control. To keep heavy media out
# of history, opt in per type:
# */raw/**/*.mp4
# */raw/**/*.mov
# */raw/**/*.zip
